# 📋 Document Management System — Full Feature Analysis

> **Date:** April 2, 2026  
> **Scope:** `src/documentManagement/` — 7 screens, ~137KB of source code  
> **Benchmark:** Enterprise-grade DMS platforms (M-Files, DocuWare, MasterControl, Veeva Vault)

