## 2. Missing Features — Gap Analysis

> [!CAUTION]
> The items marked **🔴 CRITICAL** are non-negotiable for a market-ready DMS. Without these, the product cannot be sold to enterprise customers.

### 2.1 🔴 Version Control & Document Lifecycle

| Feature | Status | Priority | Description |
|---------|--------|----------|-------------|
| Full version history tree | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Track all revisions (v1 → v2 → v3...) with a visual lineage. Currently only "v10" label shown. |
| Check-in / Check-out | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Lock a document while someone is editing to prevent conflicts. Essential for controlled environments. |
| Side-by-side version comparison | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Compare any two versions line-by-line. Current diff view is hardcoded, not functional. |
| Rollback to previous version | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Restore a document to any prior approved version with full traceability. |
| Draft / Published / Archived lifecycle | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Documents must move through defined states: Draft → In Review → Approved → Published → Archived → Obsolete. |
| Obsolescence management | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Automatically remove obsolete docs from active use; prevent accidental use of outdated procedures. |
| Effective date management | ❌ Missing | High | Define when a document becomes effective (can be different from approval date). |
| Periodic review scheduling | ⚠️ Partial | High | Review frequency is shown (e.g., "12 months") but there's no automated scheduler or countdown. |

---

### 2.2 🔴 Audit Trail & Compliance

| Feature | Status | Priority | Description |
|---------|--------|----------|-------------|
| Immutable audit trail log | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Every action (view, edit, approve, delete, download, print) must be logged with timestamp, user ID, and action type. Required by FDA 21 CFR Part 11. |
| Audit trail viewer screen | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Dedicated screen to search, filter, and export audit logs. |
| Data integrity (ALCOA+) | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Attributable, Legible, Contemporaneous, Original, Accurate — data principles for regulated industries. |
| Change reason capture | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | When modifying a document, the system must require a reason for change. |
| Compliance dashboard | ❌ Missing | High | Overview showing compliance health: expired docs, overdue reviews, training gaps. |
| 21 CFR Part 11 compliance module | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Full framework for FDA electronic records compliance. |
| ISO 9001 / ISO 13485 support | ❌ Missing | High | Template compliance frameworks for quality management standards. |

---

### 2.3 🔴 Security & Access Control

| Feature | Status | Priority | Description |
|---------|--------|----------|-------------|
| User authentication (login system) | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | No login/auth screen exists. Essential for any multi-user system. |
| Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Required for enterprise/regulated environments. |
| SSO integration (SAML/OAuth) | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Single Sign-On for enterprise deployments (Azure AD, Okta, etc.). |
| Granular RBAC at document level | ⚠️ Partial | 🔴 Critical | Current permissions are role-based (Operator/Supervisor/Quality) but only at creation time, not enforced system-wide. |
| Document-level access restrictions | ❌ Missing | High | Restrict specific docs to specific users/groups beyond role-based access. |
| Encryption at rest and in transit | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Enterprise data protection requirement. |
| Session management & timeout | ❌ Missing | High | Auto-logout after inactivity. |
| IP/Geo restriction | ❌ Missing | Medium | Limit access by network or geography. |

---

### 2.4 🔴 Electronic Signatures

| Feature | Status | Priority | Description |
|---------|--------|----------|-------------|
| Electronic signature capture | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Signing a document must capture: signer name, date/time, meaning of signature (review/approve/author). Required by 21 CFR Part 11. |
| Signature workflow (sequential/parallel) | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | Define who must sign and in what order. |
| Signature verification display | ❌ Missing | High | Show all signatures on a document with verification status. |
| Re-authentication on signature | ❌ Missing | 🔴 Critical | User must re-enter credentials when signing (FDA requirement). |

