## 5. Prioritized Implementation Roadmap

### Tier 1 — 🔴 CRITICAL (Must-Have for MVP)
*Without these, the product cannot be sold.*

```
 1. ▸ User Authentication & RBAC (login, roles, permissions)
 2. ▸ Immutable Audit Trail (all actions logged, viewer screen)
 3. ▸ Full Version Control (history tree, check-in/out, comparison, rollback)
 4. ▸ Document Lifecycle Management (Draft → Review → Approved → Published → Archived)
 5. ▸ Electronic Signatures (capture, sequential workflow, re-auth)
 6. ▸ Real File Upload & Storage (backend integration, blob storage)
 7. ▸ Full-Text Search (search inside document content)
 8. ▸ Email Notifications (assignments, approvals, rejections)
 9. ▸ Change Reason Capture (require reason when modifying docs)
10. ▸ Read & Acknowledge Tracking
```

### Tier 2 — 🟡 HIGH PRIORITY (Required for Enterprise Sales)

```
11. ▸ Visual Workflow Designer (no-code approval pipeline builder)
12. ▸ In-App Notification Center (bell icon, unread count)
13. ▸ Advanced Analytics Dashboard (charts, trends, drill-downs)
14. ▸ Document Preview Engine (render PDF/Word/Excel in-browser)
15. ▸ SSO Integration (Azure AD, Okta)
16. ▸ Training Management Module (assignment, tracking, competency)
17. ▸ Compliance Dashboard (health scorecard, gap identification)
18. ▸ REST API (expose DMS via API)
19. ▸ MFA (Multi-Factor Authentication)
20. ▸ Export to PDF/Excel
```

### Tier 3 — 🟢 DIFFERENTIATORS (Competitive Advantage)

```
21. ▸ Real AI Document Classification (ML-based auto-classify)
22. ▸ Conversational Search ("Ask Your Documents" with LLM)
23. ▸ AI Copilot for Document Authoring
24. ▸ Intelligent Document Processing (OCR + extraction)
25. ▸ Predictive Workflow Routing
26. ▸ Real-time Co-authoring
27. ▸ Mobile App / Responsive Design
28. ▸ Microsoft 365 Integration
29. ▸ ERP / QMS Integration Connectors
30. ▸ AI Compliance Gap Analysis
```

